{"id":"xyne-spaces-about","ord":"a0","title":"Xyne Spaces — the org OS","desc":"Juspay's organization context layer with collaborative apps around it: connectors pull what the org already knows (Slack, Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, more) into one permission-aware store served to people and agents; around it sit the org apps (Call, Claw, Agentic Search, Automations, Support Desk, Chat, Canvas, Tickets). TypeScript, pnpm workspace, nix flake, justfile; CI is GitHub Actions (`ci.yml` — GitHub-native, so the CI watcher watches and classifies, never launches, per dag-pr-ci).\n\nRepo: https://github.com/juspay/xyne-spaces.git · cloned at `~/code/xyne-spaces`. Added by the human 2026-09-01. Work items land beside this row as PR-shaped nodes, unmarked parents grouping as categories grow — the odu roadmap's shape.","created":"2026-09-01T15:34:09-04:00"}
